TransformWider(factor key, column value) = id=a,b | x=1.5,3.5 | y=2.5,4.5
TransformWider with no other columns = x=1.5,3.5 | y=2.5
TransformWider with two (a, x) rows and no resolution fails, as it should
TransformWider ResolveConflictsWithSum() = id=a | x=4.0 | y=4.0
TransformWider ResolveConflictsWithMean() = id=a | x=2.0 | y=4.0
TransformWider ResolveConflictsWithMean() with an x row after the y row = id=a | x=3.0 | y=4.0
TransformWider ResolveConflictsWithMinimum() = id=a | x=1.5 | y=4.0
TransformWider ResolveConflictsWithMaximum() = id=a | x=2.5 | y=4.0
TransformWider ResolveConflictsWithCount() = id=a | x=2.0 | y=1.0
TransformWider ResolveConflictsWithAppend() on text = id=a | x=hi_yo | y=ok
TransformWider with no factor fails, as it should
TransformLonger(columns x, y) = id=a,b,a,b | Names=x,x,y,y | Values=1.5,3.5,2.5,4.5
TransformLonger SetNamesHeader(key) SetValuesHeader(value) = id=a,b,a,b | key=x,x,y,y | value=1.5,3.5,2.5,4.5 (headers read back: key, value)
TransformLonger leaves the original frame unchanged = id=a,b | x=1.5,3.5 | y=2.5,4.5
TransformWider then TransformLonger = id=a,b,a,b | key=x,x,y,y | value=1.5,3.5,2.5,4.5
TransformLonger with no selected columns fails, as it should
